# What a transport and a capture show and sound like (docs/rules/combat-rules.md, transport feedback). A Federation
# destroyer boards a crippled Klingon destroyer (Prize) while a second Klingon destroyer of the model (Bystander) stands
# beside it. Shots: no effect before the order; the xtransport effect on source and target while the transport runs;
# the Prize in the Federation team color after the capture and the Bystander in its old color; no effect after the
# transport is cancelled with the chord. The WAV holds transprt.wav at each party and msboard.wav at the fight.
# Run it with --layout layouts/transport-feedback.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.5
select Boarder
press Shift+G
shot before-boarder Boarder 2
shot before-prize Prize 2
shot before-bystander Bystander 2
transport Prize
wait 0.4
shot during-boarder Boarder 2
shot during-prize Prize 2
wait 4
dump captured
shot captured-prize Prize 2
shot captured-bystander Bystander 2
shot captured-boarder Boarder 2
press T
wait 0.4
shot after-boarder Boarder 2
shot after-prize Prize 2
dump after
expect Prize team = 1
expect Bystander team = 2
